. Morimoto, A. Tissieres, and C.  Georgopolous, editors. Cold Spring Harbor Laboratory, Cold Spring Harbor, NY. 31&#x02013;52.</citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Cuervo</surname><given-names>AM</given-names></name><name><surname>Dice</surname><given-names>JF</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A receptor for the selective uptake and degradation of proteins by lysosomes</article-title><source>Science (Wash DC)</source><year>1996</year><volume>273</volume><fpage>501</fpage><lpage>503</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8662539</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Cuervo</surname><given-names>AM</given-names></name><name><surname>Terlecky</surname><given-names>SR</given-names></name><name><surname>Dice</surname><given-names>JF</given-names></name><name><surname>Knecht</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Selective binding and uptake of ribonuclease A and glyceraldehyde-3-phosphate dehydrogenase by isolated rat liver lysosomes</article-title><source>J Biol Chem</source><year>1994</year><volume>269</volume><fpage>26374</fpage><lpage>26380</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7929357</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Cuervo</surname><given-names>AM</given-names></name><name><surname>Terlecky</surname><given-names>SR</given-names></name><name><surname>Knecht</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Dice</surname><given-names>JF</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Activation of a selective pathway of lysosomal proteolysis in rat liver by prolonged starvation</article-title><source>Am J Physiol</source><year>1995</year><volume>269</volume><fpage>C1200</fpage><lpage>C1208</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7491910</pub-id></citation>